// template: Eternal Horizon
// order: 1
// Classic European uplifting trance with an Arabian colour: offbeat bass, gated pluck
// chords, a long breakdown with piano and strings, a snare roll into a supersaw drop, and a
// lead in harmonic minor (the raised seventh is why the melodic tracks are `free`).
// Every melody is original.
title "Eternal Horizon"
tempo 138
key d minor
kick:    kick       bright   x... x... x... x... | gain 0.9
bass:    bass       bright   . . d2 . . . d2 . . . d2 . . . d2 . / . . bb1 . . . bb1 . . . bb1 . . . bb1 . / . . f1 . . . f1 . . . f1 . . . f1 . / . . a1 . . . a1 . . . a1 . . . a1 .   | duck 0.8 | cutoff sine(16) 900..2400 | gain 2
hat:     hat        dusty    x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x | pan -0.2 | gain 0.35
ohat:    hat        open     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | pan 0.2 | gain 0.45
clap:    clap       tight    .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 0.6
ride:    ride       ping     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | pan 0.3 | gain 0.4
roll:    snare      snap     x... x... x... x... / x... x... x... x... / x... x... x... x... / x... x... x... x... / x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. / x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. / xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx / xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx   | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.6 | reverb wide
gate:    pluck      bright   Dm . Dm Dm . Dm . Dm Dm . Dm . Dm Dm . Dm / Bb . Bb Bb . Bb . Bb Bb . Bb . Bb Bb . Bb / F . F F . F . F F . F . F F . F / A . A A . A . A A . A . Asus4 Asus4 . A   | free | duck 0.6 | delay 3/16 | reverb room | gain 0.31
pad:     pad        sea      Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / A ~ ~ ~                 | free | voicing spread | brightness sine(16) 0.3..0.7 | duck 0.6 | reverb sea | gain 0.55
saws:    supersaw   anthem   Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / A ~ ~ ~                 | free | duck 0.9 | release 0.5 | reverb wide | gain 0.4
arp:     pluck      steel    Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / A ~ ~ ~                 | free | arp up | arp-rate 1/16 | arp-octaves 2 | highpass 500 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | gain 0.34
lead:    lead       anthem     a4 ~ bb4 a4 g4 ~ a4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ g4 a4 ~ bb4 ~ / c5 ~ bb4 a4 g4 ~ f4 ~ / e4 ~ f4 g4 c#5 ~ ~ ~   | free | detune 0.5 | attack 0.01 | release 0.6 | glide 0.04 | delay 3/16 | reverb sea | gain 0.21
piano:   piano      grand    a4 ~ bb4 a4 g4 ~ a4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ g4 a4 ~ bb4 ~ / c5 ~ bb4 a4 g4 ~ f4 ~ / e4 ~ f4 g4 c#5 ~ ~ ~   | free | reverb sea | gain 0.55
strings: strings    high     Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / A ~ ~ ~                 | free | voicing spread | reverb sea | gain 0.41
choir:   choir      ethereal      Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / A ~ ~ ~                 | free | reverb sea | gain 0.35
rise:    noise      white    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..10000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser      both     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 13.9 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash      wide     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.5
impact:  impact     metal    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.75
section intro   kick hat ohat arp
section groove  kick bass hat ohat clap gate | loop
section build   kick bass hat ohat clap gate arp rise
section break   pad piano strings choir down
section lift    pad strings arp roll riser
section drop    kick bass hat ohat clap ride gate saws lead choir crash impact
section groove2 kick bass hat ohat clap ride gate arp
section break2  piano strings choir lead down
section drop2   kick bass hat ohat clap ride gate saws arp lead strings choir crash impact
section outro   kick hat ohat arp
song intro 16, groove 32, build 16, break 32, lift 8, drop 32, groove2 16, break2 16, lift 8, drop2 32, outro 16
